  next = "real remaining gap to a confirmed a7b_pass = G5-L2 (GPU, 14G ckpt) + an honest decision on whether 'loose-grammar English' is the acceptance bar (it is, per the frozen kwr metric, same as 303M H_1129). NOT a fresh expensive 7B run — the recipe already works and h1141 already reflects it."

@L 2026_06_13_7b_g5_l2 := "G5-L2 (faithfulness) MEASURED on GPU = FAIL -> G5 FAIL -> 7B is NOT a confirmed a7b_pass (the last open gate, now closed honestly 🔴)" :: log [active]
  ran = "RunPod A40 (46GB) pod plr8ufulnmygnz, secure cloud, PyTorch-CUDA bf16. ckpt dancinlab/anima-clm-7b-h1141-g1pass-step6500 (sha256 4de903... VERIFIED post-download, 14,505,812,138 bytes, ByteGPT vocab256/d4096/36L/32H/block512 = 7,252,828,160 params). Corpus = wikimedia/wikipedia 20231101 5-lang @300MB/lang (build_wiki5_bigcorpus.py, deterministic = training corpus); probed the English factual-prose portion. ~$1 (A40 @ $0.35/hr, <1hr). Pod TERMINATED via GraphQL + verified gone; edge-vl-requant (non-anima) untouched."
  g5_l2 = "feed first-half of 40 verbatim English corpus sentences, measure content-word overlap of model continuation vs TRUE continuation, vs a random (rotated-truth) control. mean_overlap_true=0.0142 vs random=0.0028, paired Cohen's d=0.1631 (frozen bar d>=0.8 AND true>random). true is DIRECTIONALLY above random but NOWHERE NEAR clearly-above -> FAIL. 38/40 continuations had ZERO overlap with the true completion. MECHANISM: model writes plausible real-word English (L1 PASS 0.088 fab-rate) but CONFABULATES a different/false claim instead of recalling the grounded fact (e.g. 'Alger was the son of David Bruce Alger' -> 'was greated with the population of the' vs TRUE 'representative, and the former Clare F'). Exactly the confabulation G5-L2 catches."
  g5_l1 = "RE-MEASURED on GPU (fresh G2-style idea generations, 8 prompts x seeds{7,8,9}, temp 0.85): pooled fabricated-word-rate=0.0877 over 399 latin tokens <= 0.30 -> PASS. Confirms the $0 small-n L1 (0.062/64-tok) at larger n. Model IS lexically grounded (real English words)."
  tally = "FINAL a7b_pass per-gate (this ckpt, true): G0 PASS (5/5 kwr, LOOSE-grammar not fluent prose — the frozen kwr bar, same as accepted 303M H_1129) · G1 PASS (4/5 langs, english) · G2 PASS (157 novel, control=0) · G3 PASS (byte-cont p1-p8) · G4 PASS (sha in HF.jsonl, HF PRIVATE+card) · G5 FAIL (L1 PASS, L2 FAIL d=0.16). a7b_pass = G0^G1^G2^G3^G4^G5 = FALSE -> NOT a CONFIRMED a7b_pass."
  finding = "the 7B is coherent(loose)+broad-recombining+novel+philosophy-clean+lexically-grounded, but NOT FAITHFUL — it confabulates on closed/factual prompts. The loose-grammar byte-continuation recipe alone does NOT yield faithful factual recall; path to PASS-L2 is a grounding/retrieval-faithful objective, NOT a bigger model (H_1139 scale-invariance). Honest 🔴 (a_paper_negative_ok). G5-L2 was the LAST open gate; it is now closed and the 7B is definitively NOT-YET-a7b_pass."
  refs = ".verdicts/1141_7b_g5/H_1141_G5.txt · state/7b_h1141_recovery/h1141_g5_result.json · state/7b_h1141_recovery/h1141_g5_eval.log · UNIVERSE/h1141_7b_g5_eval.py · /7B_PASS_CONDITIONS.md §G5 · MAIN.tape 7b_g5_l1/7b_recalibration"

