@L 2026_06_13_h1198 := "H_1198 🟢 GREEN LIVE-GROWTH-ON-REAL-CORPUS — the NEXT rung after H_1197's synthetic 1-D stream: drove the live H_1194 AdaptField mitosis growth over a REAL corpus byte stream on summer ($0, gradient-free p8), with a learned-surprise novelty driver from a GPU-trained byte-Transformer reader (H_1193, 1.46M params, val_ce 2.295 bits/byte). LIVE .hexa engine over the 1-D real-corpus surprise: cells grew 19→30, recon-err(ON) 0.204→0.095, late ON=0.0996 vs OFF(frozen-cap)=1.5152 = 15.2x, Ψ Φ-checksum byte-identical ON==OFF (326.977). DIM=8 surprise-gated numpy MIRROR (5 seeds): cells 1→~70 vs 1 OFF, late ON=0.170 vs OFF=1.267 = 7.4x. The H_1159 ON<OFF adaptation HOLDS on REAL data across BOTH the live 1-D engine and the DIM=8 mirror. Ended at 30/~70 cells << N_MIGRATE=2048 — summer CPU correct host, migration NOT warranted. engine_cli_smoke 12/0 re-verified; co-tenant rbfe-prod untouched." :: log [active]
