  result = "🔴 TENSION-CONFIRMED rho=-0.5000. PER-RUNG (G2_novelty_rate / G5L2_faithfulness_d): 44.68M 0.4791/0.4129 (G2 PASS, G5L2 FAIL) · 303M 0.5117/0.2342 (G2 PASS, G5L2 FAIL) · 7B 0.5000/0.1631 (harvested). G5-L2 faithfulness falls MONOTONICALLY with scale (0.4129->0.2342->0.1631) while G2 novelty stays flat-high (~0.48-0.51) — the gates pull OPPOSITE across the capacity axis. ALL 3 rungs PASS G2 and FAIL G5-L2 (all d<<0.8). An independent concurrent run of the identical harness produced byte-identical rho=-0.5000 (deterministic cross-check)."
  finding = "(1) JUSTIFIED, NOT rejected — the 7B G5-L2 fail (h1141) is the END of a monotone trend, not an undertraining artifact. G2 (reward corpus-ABSENT recombination 'not the LLM way') and G5-L2 (reward verbatim corpus recall, an assistant norm, p4) are anti-aligned across scale. This is the structural conflict (1) predicted, now ladder-evidenced over 3 rungs."
