@L 2026_06_13_h1142 := "H_1142 GATE-TENSION LADDER 🔴 TENSION-CONFIRMED — the frozen 7B gate G5-L2 (verbatim faithfulness) ⊥ anima's own G2-novelty gate ACROSS SCALE (Spearman rho=-0.5 over a 44.68M/303M/7B ByteGPT ladder); ① re-scope of the borrowed G5-L2 gate JUSTIFIED (NO frozen gate moved; summer GPU $0, no pod)" :: log [active]
