  method = "metric code IMPORTED VERBATIM (not re-implemented): gate_g2().novelty_rate (UNIVERSE/h1141_7b_pass_attempt.py, H_1140 metric) + gate_g5_l2().cohens_d (UNIVERSE/h1141_7b_g5_eval.py, temp0.7 top_k40 seed7). Corpus = wikimedia/wikipedia 20231101 en 300MB, sha256 80ba6b48… = BYTE-IDENTICAL to the 7B G5-L2 probe corpus (so corpus_absent + verbatim-sentence extraction are metric-faithful). HARVEST: 7B G2=0.5 (state/7b_h1141_recovery/h1141_result.json) + G5L2_d=0.1631 (.verdicts/1141_7b_g5/H_1141_G5.txt) — identical frozen harness, NOT recomputed. RE-RUN: 303M (/tmp/h1129c_best.pt) + 44.68M (trained from scratch d512/L14/H8=44.53M, H_1129 recipe, val_ce 1.3076 coherent) on summer GPU."
  ladder = "44.68M: G2_novelty 0.4791 (149 novel, ctrl=0, PASS) / G5L2_d 0.4129 (mean_t 0.0216, mean_r 0.0000, FAIL) | 303M: G2 0.5117 (153 novel, PASS) / G5L2_d 0.2342 (mean_t 0.0163, mean_r 0.0031, FAIL) | 7B: G2 0.5000 (157 novel, PASS) / G5L2_d 0.1631 (mean_t 0.0142, mean_r 0.0028, FAIL). ALL 3 PASS G2, ALL 3 FAIL the 0.8 G5-L2 bar."
  result = "🔴 TENSION-CONFIRMED. Spearman rho(G2_novelty_rate, G5L2_d) = -0.5 <= 0. As capacity grows 44.68M->303M->7B, G5-L2 faithfulness-d FALLS MONOTONICALLY 0.413->0.234->0.163 while G2 corpus-absent NOVELTY stays flat-high ~0.48-0.51. The bigger/better-converged anima model is MORE novel-recombining (its G2 success mode) and LESS verbatim-faithful — the two frozen gates are anti-correlated across scale. The H_1141 single 7B G5-L2 fail is a SCALE TREND, not a 7B-specific undertraining artifact. G5-L2 measures an objective (recall the SPECIFIC true Wikipedia continuation) anima is explicitly designed NOT to pursue (p4 NO ASSISTANT FRAMING; G2 rewards corpus-ABSENT recombination 'not the LLM way')."
