  honest = "a_scale_honest_scope: 3-rung MINIMUM ladder, toy/surface p7 metric (word-overlap + /usr/share/dict, NOT perplexity, NOT LLM-judge), scale-transfer beyond these 3 points UNVERIFIED. rho=-0.5 is what a clean monotone-decreasing 3-point relation gives under Spearman with one near-tie at the top (G2 7B 0.500 just below 303M 0.512); the G5-L2 axis is STRICTLY monotone decreasing (0.413>0.234>0.163), the load-bearing trend; n=3 => rho coarse by construction. The 44.68M d=0.413 has mean_random=0.000 (tiny model so ungrounded the rotated control collapses to zero, inflating its paired-d) — read as artifact-inflated-but-<<0.8; the 303M->7B fall (0.234->0.163, both real non-zero controls) carries the trend independently. a_paper_negative_ok."
